  Charming_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Yes! Yes! I can do that!
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1da91c30447c3f4993c88d7851b5b9f, type: 3}
      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 1732592836512686072, guid: ef44ce4f2cc40dd43933e177fba7a7ef, type: 3}
      AudioResponse: Happy
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: If I PROMISE to play later, will you let me open up all of my
      other gifts first?
    RelationshipCheckRequired: 0
